<title>UK: BBL sets 400 million Danish crown Dec 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>BBL sets 400 million Danish crown Dec 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Bruxelles Lambert SA.</p>
<p> BORROWER    BBL INTERNATIONAL FINANCE SA</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANQUE BRUXELLES LAMBERT SA</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    22.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE  L-22.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
